  "prefLabel": "Ncr 843.07 Reimbursement Rates for Grading and Grooming",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 843.07 Reimbursement Rates for Grading and Grooming. The bureau chief shall have the authority to set the hourly reimbursement rates for grading and grooming in consultation with the OHRV and snowmobile advisory committees.\n\nSource. #14293, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr800.html"
